ff 拉满吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18149950\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9f39f8cd478ef2a21d7a6c81949c0eb5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"testsb\" data-uid=\"187502\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/testsb\">testsb</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 09:34:24 +08:00\">22h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只能 sol 6.1 凑合着用，能力尚可，今天 Tibo 说 Astra 和 Sol 优化提速了 50%，确实比之前的龟速快了一些</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18149962\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/478b/9b9a/716657_normal.png?m=1732962308\" alt=\"follower\" data-uid=\"716657\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/follower\">follower</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 09:50:38 +08:00\">22h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我 200 刀套餐，Astra xhigh fast 正好够用，不过我只用它来照着文档写代码，写需求和审代码用 20 刀的 Opus 5.5</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18149972\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3ae3/1324/171697_normal.png?m=1703596600\" alt=\"geese1028\" data-uid=\"171697\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/geese1028\">geese1028</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 09:59:24 +08:00\">22h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>主流程 sol 6.1 ，astra 负责验收和审计，luna 负责干脏活累活。<br>3 天烧完缩水之后的 Pro 200 的周额度</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150048\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/25efca467527b262608bc12f80387112?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ovtfkw\" data-uid=\"253965\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ovtfkw\">ovtfkw</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 10:46:04 +08:00\">21h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>6.1 sol high 搭配时不时的重置，plus 都很够用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150080\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0cda5f769349fe349999d4ce56b3a83f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"idealhs\" data-uid=\"412503\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/idealhs\">idealhs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 10:59:31 +08:00\">21h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>20x 的时候 Astra Ultra 够我超高强度用一天，或者是分着好几天用，那一周刚好混过去。改了 10x 后面不知道怎么办呢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150082\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/757f/8ff4/208186_normal.png?m=1779428467\" alt=\"dushixiang\" data-uid=\"208186\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n        