              <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MrBearin\">MrBearin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 11:43:01 +08:00\">20h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>就别想 Astra 了, 6.1 就行了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150176\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/305c/9872/378986_normal.png?m=1781599564\" alt=\"aahao\" data-uid=\"378986\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/aahao\">aahao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 12:01:42 +08:00\">20h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>所以你为什么要用 6 astra ultra 来改代码？能走路去的地方，你要坐飞机去，然后嫌贵？买个私人飞机可以解决</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150183\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7d468fae60e29fc9eaa800e5b62d9ee1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"renmu\" data-uid=\"268809\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/renmu\">renmu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 12:06:11 +08:00\">19h 59m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我开 6.1sol ，我的速度怎么都用不完。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150214\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2651d2e06496c1ef4e0e9e10081dc183?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jko123\" data-uid=\"222376\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jko123\">jko123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 12:39:49 +08:00\">19h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你都开 Astra ultra 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150251\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/95e31440ccd2ff3d03b29a5bf3b48b6d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"winnerczwx\" data-uid=\"297433\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/winnerczwx\">winnerczwx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 13:24:12 +08:00\">18h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我用 fast+astra+ultra 六七个小时能跑完 20x 周额度</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150257\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3718158848a11957c52edcc2a8271756?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yuanzheng0922\" data-uid=\"317476\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yuanzheng0922\">yuanzheng0922</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 13:28:54 +08:00\">18h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我 20x 的，astra 不够用，6.1sol 太慢了，开 max fast 都慢的不行，我俩任务挂一夜都掉不了 10%，服了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150476\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0c77d4307da5ebc8e4ac382311a22e08?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"acupnocup\" data-uid=\"288843\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/acupnocup\">acupnocup</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 16:31:52 +08:00\">15h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>退回到 100 刀了，因为发现 200 刀根本就用不完，从来使用超过 20% 过。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150573\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2f59b786fd9cd2ec2b95720531ebbe83?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Y25tIGxpdmlk\" data-uid=\"623288\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Y25tIGxpdmlk\">Y25tIGxpdmlk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 17:42:48 +08:00\">14h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>你可真会享受呢。直接用最高档的，能不快吗。</p><p>我用 5.6sol,我感觉我做的东西，用 5.6sol 都绰绰有余了，又不是设计核电站</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150587\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/968fc1db4487a6c2a94f256960940a6f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"stdout\" data-uid=\"368529\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/stdout\">stdout</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 17:55:50 +08:00\">14h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我还是蹬 astra low 普通模式，都 3 天蹬完 200 美金的周额度，这里面还是用 astra 指挥 grok 和 agy 干，还是很快用完。grok 倒是非常耐用，改前端还是要 agy 3.8 flash, 最让我惊喜的是 glm 5.3 flash ，有些艺术场景下世界第一。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150590\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ffca59c5ffc890b3fd7065b5f93bf4ae?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"deplives\" data-uid=\"456093\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/deplives\">deplives</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 18:00:41 +08:00\">14h 5m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>再开个 fast 把 buff 叠满， 再问一遍我就开了个 ultra fast 为啥一句话就用了 50% 的周额度</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150637\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9b48c21b50efb7776d75259eb374cbda?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"unpay\" data-uid=\"610890\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/unpay\">unpay</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 18:45:56 +08:00\">13h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看任务吧。。我这边还好吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150639\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/19f41ad7f989230efe1943b388cad324?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xenme\" data-uid=\"64558\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xenme\">xenme</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 18:47:37 +08:00\">1